UpdatePropertyStatusTest
├── when the property does not exist
│   └── it should revert with PropertyDoesNotExist
├── when the property exists
│   ├── when the caller is neither verifier nor property issuer
│   │   └── it should revert with NotPropertyIssuer
│   ├── when the caller is the property issuer or verifier
│   │   ├── when the contract is paused
│   │   │   └── it should revert with EnforcedPause
│   │   └── when the contract is not paused
│   │       ├── VALID TRANSITIONS - FROM PLANNING
│   │       │   ├── when transitioning from Planning to InConstruction
│   │       │   │   ├── it should update the status
│   │       │   │   └── it should emit PropertyStatusUpdated event
│   │       │   └── when transitioning from Planning to Cancelled
│   │       │       ├── it should update the status
│   │       │       └── it should emit PropertyStatusUpdated event
│   │       ├── INVALID TRANSITIONS - FROM PLANNING
│   │       │   ├── when trying Planning to Planning (same state)
│   │       │   │   └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       │   ├── when trying Planning to Completed (skip state)
│   │       │   │   └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       │   └── when trying Planning to Sold (skip states)
│   │       │       └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       ├── VALID TRANSITIONS - FROM IN CONSTRUCTION
│   │       │   ├── when transitioning from InConstruction to Completed
│   │       │   │   ├── it should update the status
│   │       │   │   ├── it should set actualCompletion timestamp
│   │       │   │   ├── it should emit PropertyCompleted event
│   │       │   │   └── it should emit PropertyStatusUpdated event
│   │       │   └── when transitioning from InConstruction to Cancelled
│   │       │       ├── it should update the status
│   │       │       └── it should emit PropertyStatusUpdated event
│   │       ├── INVALID TRANSITIONS - FROM IN CONSTRUCTION
│   │       │   ├── when trying InConstruction to InConstruction (same state)
│   │       │   │   └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       │   ├── when trying InConstruction to Planning (backwards)
│   │       │   │   └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       │   └── when trying InConstruction to Sold (skip state)
│   │       │       └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       ├── VALID TRANSITIONS - FROM COMPLETED
│   │       │   └── when transitioning from Completed to Sold
│   │       │       ├── it should update the status
│   │       │       └── it should emit PropertyStatusUpdated event
│   │       ├── INVALID TRANSITIONS - FROM COMPLETED
│   │       │   ├── when trying Completed to Completed (same state)
│   │       │   │   └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       │   ├── when trying Completed to Planning (backwards)
│   │       │   │   └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       │   ├── when trying Completed to InConstruction (backwards)
│   │       │   │   └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       │   └── when trying Completed to Cancelled (not allowed)
│   │       │       └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       ├── INVALID TRANSITIONS - FROM SOLD (FINAL STATE)
│   │       │   ├── when trying Sold to Planning
│   │       │   │   └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       │   ├── when trying Sold to InConstruction
│   │       │   │   └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       │   ├── when trying Sold to Completed
│   │       │   │   └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       │   ├── when trying Sold to Sold (same state)
│   │       │   │   └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       │   └── when trying Sold to Cancelled
│   │       │       └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       ├── INVALID TRANSITIONS - FROM CANCELLED (FINAL STATE)
│   │       │   ├── when trying Cancelled to Planning
│   │       │   │   └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       │   ├── when trying Cancelled to InConstruction
│   │       │   │   └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       │   ├── when trying Cancelled to Completed
│   │       │   │   └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       │   ├── when trying Cancelled to Sold
│   │       │   │   └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
│   │       │   └── when trying Cancelled to Cancelled (same state)
│   │       │       └── it should revert with InvalidStatusTransition
